    "replace_to": "https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app",
    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"What our patients say\",\"title\":\"Circumcision Reviews \\u0026 Patient Testimonials\",\"lede\":\"Choosing where to have a circumcision is an important decision.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Testimonials\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Many of the babies, children and adults we see at Beverley Clinic come to us following a recommendation from a family member, friend or previous patient.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We are grateful to the thousands of patients and parents who have taken the time to share their experiences of our clinic through Google, Trustpilot, Yell, video testimonials and feedback sent directly to us.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Below you can read and watch some of their experiences.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book an appointment</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"independent-reviews\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"independent-reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Independent Reviews of Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"eyebrow\":\"What our patients and parents say\",\"lede\":\"Read our latest independently published reviews.\"} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"cil-review-platform-buttons\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons cil-review-platform-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://g.page/circumcisioninlondon/review?id\">Read our Google reviews</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.yell.com/biz/circumcision-in-london-edgware-6864473/\">Read our Yell reviews</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"why-patients-choose-us\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"why-patients-choose-us\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Why Patients Choose Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"Every patient and family has their own reasons for choosing a circumcision clinic, but there are several themes that appear repeatedly in the feedback we receive.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Circumcision is a core part of our clinical work\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe perform circumcision regularly for babies, toddlers, children, teenagers and adults.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur practitioners have extensive experience of circumcision and have also trained doctors from the UK and abroad in safe circumcision techniques.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Clear explanations before the procedure\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePatients and parents frequently tell us how important it was to understand what would happen before the circumcision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide preparation information before treatment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Care for all ages\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision from infancy through childhood and adolescence to adulthood.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe technique used is selected according to the patient\\u0026#039;s age, anatomy and individual circumstances.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Support does not finish when you leave the clinic\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePatients receive written aftercare information and guidance following their procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe make a next-day telephone call and provide follow-up during healing where required.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Recommendations from other families\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA significant proportion of our patients come through word-of-mouth recommendations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe also regularly see families return to us for another son or recommend the clinic to relatives and friends.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Independent patient feedback\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eRather than asking visitors simply to take our word for it, we encourage prospective patients and parents to read independent reviews and make their own decision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/about/\">About Beverley Clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/\">Meet our practitioners</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"selected-testimonials\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\" id=\"selected-testimonials\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Selected Patient Testimonials\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"A small selection of written feedback from patients and parents who have attended Beverley Clinic.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/quotes-grid {\"quotes\":[{\"name\":\"Derayt Omer\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"I honestly cannot thank Dr Haidar enough for the amazing care and kindness he showed towards my little son. He was absolutely wonderful from start to finish. The way he treated my son was so gentle, caring and professional, and he made us feel completely comfortable and reassured.\\n\\nDr Haidar is not only an excellent doctor, but also a genuinely kind and caring person. He went above and beyond, and we are extremely grateful for everything he did for our little boy.\\n\\nHe is truly a top-class person and an absolute star. ⭐️ I would highly recommend Dr Haidar to anyone. Thank you so much, Doctor, for your kindness and wonderful care. We will never forget it! ❤️\"},{\"name\":\"Nuredin vokrri\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"We had an excellent experience at this clinic. My son, who is 7 years old, recently had a circumcision procedure here, and I truly couldn’t be more grateful for the care we received.\\n\\nFrom the very beginning, the staff were kind, professional, and reassuring. They took the time to explain everything clearly, which helped ease both my son’s and my own worries. The doctors were highly skilled and handled the surgery with great care and attention.\\n\\nMost importantly, my son felt safe and comfortable throughout the whole process. The recovery has been smooth, and the results are exactly what we hoped for. It’s clear that the team genuinely cares about their patients and their families.\\n\\nThank you to everyone at the clinic for your outstanding work and compassion. I would highly recommend this clinic to any parent looking for quality care.\"},{\"name\":\"Zubeir Uddin\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"Coming from Southampton, I’ve had both of my sons circumcised here, first in 2025 and again in 2026. Alhamdulillah, both experiences were excellent. I genuinely cannot recommend this clinic highly enough to other parents.\\n\\nThe staff are incredibly friendly and professional. They explain the procedure and aftercare clearly, so you always feel informed and reassured. During the circumcision itself, they showed real care and compassion towards my sons, making the whole process look effortless. It was quick, calm, and handled with true expertise.\\n\\nWhat really stood out is the followup. They even call afterwards to check that everything is okay, which shows how much they value their patients.\\n\\nThank you so much for everything you’ve done for our family!\"},{\"name\":\"Janeth Harmath\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"We had an excellent experience at the circumcision clinic for our son. From the moment we arrived, the staff were kind, professional, and very reassuring.Dr Haidar Al-Ali took the time to explain the procedure clearly, answer all of our questions, and make sure we felt comfortable throughout the entire process.\\n\\nThe clinic was spotless and well-organized, which gave us even more confidence in the care being provided. Most importantly, our son was treated with such gentleness and compassion, and his recovery went smoothly thanks to the clear aftercare instructions we were given.\\n\\nWe are truly grateful for the care and attention we received and would highly recommend this clinic to any parents looking for safe and professional treatment for their child.\"},{\"name\":\"Ahmed Banko\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"I brought my newborn here for his circumcision four days ago, and I couldn’t be more impressed with the experience. The level of professionalism from the staff was outstanding; they were calm, reassuring, and clearly very experienced.\\n\\nI had expected the procedure to be quite distressing, but it was handled so smoothly that my baby barely cried, which was a huge relief. We were also given clear, thorough aftercare instructions, which made the recovery process much less stressful.\\n\\nJust a few days later, my baby is healing really well and already doing much better. I’m very grateful for the care we received and would absolutely recommend this clinic to other parents.\"},{\"name\":\"Quaye Hammond\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"I can’t recommend the circumcision clinic enough. The customer service was outstanding, and the care was excellent. We planned to use the ring method, but they recommended forceps for our baby boy, as it meant faster recovery in his case. Despite that change, everything went completely smoothly. The anesthetic ensured no pain during the procedure, and afterward, discomfort was minimal—only when using the toilet. By day three, he was already fine, and by two to three weeks, everything looked perfect. We’d absolutely return—the team made it easy, smooth, and reassuring. Don’t waste your time looking anywhere else. Use the Beverly clinic.\"},{\"name\":\"Patryk Dziopa\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"Adult circumcision:\\n\\nAbsolutely outstanding experience. The procedure was painless, the staff were extremely friendly, and the doctor was clearly very experienced and knowledgeable. I was given a very detailed aftercare plan with clear advice that made recovery simple and stressfree. Highly recommended.\"},{\"name\":\"muhamad azwan ismail\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"Long trip from Plymouth and greeted by an exceptional service from Dr Samir and team. The “bloodless” procedure is amazing and really helps my son recovers from circumcision. It took about 1 week+ for him to get fully healed. Thank so much! To parents, don’t forget the big tub of vaseline as you need it loads!\"},{\"name\":\"Helal Attayee\",\"context\":\"Google review\",\"quote\":\"I had my son’s circumcision last week at the Beverley Clinic, and I was truly impressed with the entire experience. From the reception team to Dr Samir Al-Ali, everyone was professional, welcoming, and supportive.\\n\\nAs a medical professional myself, I particularly appreciated Dr Al-Ali’s approach. He was polite, patient, and highly professional, while also being warm and reassuring throughout the process.\\n\\nThe level of care and service provided by the clinic exceeded my expectations. I would highly recommend this wonderful clinic to anyone considering their services.\"}],\"perPage\":0,\"showStars\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"video-testimonials\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"video-testimonials\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Video Testimonials\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"eyebrow\":\"Hear directly from our patients and parents\",\"lede\":\"Some patients and parents have kindly agreed to share their experience of Beverley Clinic on video.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>These testimonials provide an opportunity to hear directly from people who have attended the clinic and learn about their experience before, during and after circumcision.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/video-grid {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 1\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-4542.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-4542.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 2\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-4557.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-4557.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 3\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-4799.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-4799.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Video testimonial 4\",\"mediaKey\":\"testimonials/videos/img-5411.mp4\",\"posterKey\":\"testimonials/posters/img-5411.jpg\"}],\"showHead\":false,\"layout\":\"cards\"} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/video-testimonials/\">Watch more video testimonials</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"make-your-own-decision\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"make-your-own-decision\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-2\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-2\">Read the Reviews. Ask Questions. Make Your Own Decision.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We understand that choosing a circumcision clinic involves trust.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We encourage you to read our Google, Trustpilot and Yell reviews, watch our video testimonials and look through feedback from patients and parents before deciding whether Beverley Clinic is right for you or your child.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you have questions before booking, please contact us.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"wp-block-buttons cil-consultation-buttons-grid\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons cil-consultation-buttons-grid\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\">Book an appointment</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">Contact us</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/prices/\">View circumcision prices</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us anything\",\"formId\":\"testimonials\",\"subject\":\"testimonials page enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->",
